                                                "sense_id": "00bad501-1bbb-37b6-85e6-3f85b8d73b54",
                                                "text": "The slang term groovy has lost some of its neologicity over time, and is now considered somewhat dated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebfd8114-1975-4e88-8c0a-025b84d682b2",
                                                "sense_id": "00bad501-1bbb-37b6-85e6-3f85b8d73b54",
                                                "text": "The neologicity of newly discovered concepts, i.e. their instability is reinforced even more by the constant supply of new concepts as well as by \"the influence that these exercise on the resemantization of the paradigm which takes place in the treated subfield\" (P. Wijnands, 1991)."
                                            }
